/*  CONSTANT NAME:      _dirNW
    DESCRIPTION:*//**The scalar position-delta for north-west (up-left): rowDelta -1, colDelta -1 encoded as rowDelta*100000+colDelta (default mult 100000). Arrow twin: _arrowNW.*/
